{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunblade Ranger is a post-apocalyptic Roguelike top-down shooter. You will use guns and blades to hunt monsters in randomly generated radiation zones, collect mutant abilities, break into the source of the radiation, and face the final challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo offers 20-30 minutes of gameplay, about 30% of the full game's content. It includes 2 playable characters, 22 firearms, 16 mutant abilities, 2 area levels, and bosses. We hope this limited demo gives you an experience close to the full version. Please note that save files from the demo are not compatible with the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Battlefield </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level environments and monster characters are all hand-drawn. We hope you can immerse yourself in this vivid, cartoonish post-apocalyptic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Rangers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unique ranger heroes debut, each with their own exclusive skills and traits. Combine skill builds and equipment to create a wide variety of combat styles. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/6aac689fbe189bc33144a987d8ce4ccd.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/6aac689fbe189bc33144a987d8ce4ccd.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/6aac689fbe189bc33144a987d8ce4ccd.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blade Tactics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your blade to parry and quickly execute enemies is a major feature of this game. Enjoy the rhythm of combat as you weave through a hail of bullets. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/4f59c4d7d604757045695a989b5d438f.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/4f59c4d7d604757045695a989b5d438f.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/4f59c4d7d604757045695a989b5d438f.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vast Guns</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers over 20 types of ranged firearms, 5 types of tactical gear, and 16 mutant skills. Every run is a brand new art of combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/2fd68830d46b35fb87f222d03db81453.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/2fd68830d46b35fb87f222d03db81453.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/2fd68830d46b35fb87f222d03db81453.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mutation Builds</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incorporates Roguelike skill-building gameplay. Freely create mutation combinations and forge your own skill school.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/3b25195a9d1c53c0851826d850a591fe.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/3b25195a9d1c53c0851826d850a591fe.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/3b25195a9d1c53c0851826d850a591fe.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Maps \u2014 In 2 procedurally generated main levels and hidden areas, encounter 2 powerful bosses and face a perilous post-apocalyptic battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/f590285a4bd119ba38dda3a074879493.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/f590285a4bd119ba38dda3a074879493.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/f590285a4bd119ba38dda3a074879493.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/d30f352b3c700f26eb4409aab2019642.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/d30f352b3c700f26eb4409aab2019642.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/d30f352b3c700f26eb4409aab2019642.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your magazine runs dry, can you carve a path to survival through the radiation waves and end the tide that devours civilization with your ultimate skills?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906050?t=1754848055","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906050?t=1754848055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/8f4167baf43876e43b23cfc74f30a02c3cfdd9b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754848055","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/8f4167baf43876e43b23cfc74f30a02c3cfdd9b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754848055","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"1.During gameplay, characters will encounter cartoonish depictions of blood splatter and stylized skeletal remains when defeating enemies.\r\n2.The game contains violent use of firearms, weapons (including prop-based armaments), and explosive devices."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gunblade Ranger is a post-apocalyptic Roguelike top-down shooter. You will use guns and blades to hunt monsters in randomly generated radiation zones, collect mutant abilities, break into the source of the radiation, and face the final challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo offers 20-30 minutes of gameplay, about 30% of the full game's content. It includes 2 playable characters, 22 firearms, 16 mutant abilities, 2 area levels, and bosses. We hope this limited demo gives you an experience close to the full version. Please note that save files from the demo are not compatible with the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Drawn Battlefield </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level environments and monster characters are all hand-drawn. We hope you can immerse yourself in this vivid, cartoonish post-apocalyptic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.poster.avif?t=1754848055\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.webm?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906050/extras/ed57f1c70e8473ec3032e4fcfe46d094.mp4?t=1754848055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Legendary Rangers</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 unique ranger heroes debut, each with their own exclusive skills and traits. Combine skill builds and equipment to create a wide variety of combat styles. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.